/// `gitlab_list_mrs` — GET `projects/{id}/merge_requests?state=…`.
///
/// Ports the Java `listMergeRequests`: `open` → `opened`; `closed` → `all`
/// plus a client-side filter keeping only closed/merged MRs. Single page of
